 AR4("Governance is broader than government.", "Governance includes citizens, media, civil society and private bodies in addition to government institutions.", "a",
     "Government means institutions that exercise authority; governance covers how governing is done with many actors."),
 AR4("Transparency builds trust in governance.", "DigiLocker is used to store documents digitally.", "b",
     "Both are true but the second does not explain the first."),
